@display("std/jsonrpc")
jsonrpc: part {
  | Binds apis and ops to JSON-RPC 2.0 methods and notifications, framed for HTTP, the language
  | server protocol, length-prefixed streams or WebSockets.
  |
  | Its surface is declared in `std/jsonrpc/package.heron`, whose types the API reference renders.
  | `@jsonrpc`, `@params`, `@code` and their enums are specified in [JSON-RPC](#language.apis.jsonrpc).
}
